Z||000010||mrfixit58||04-05-2001||10:05 AM||||Althought I haven't personally purchased anything from them, they frequently come to our monthly meetings. A lot of the products they offer are from by recommendations by members of our club (Suncoast Fieros). I, personally, made the recommendation for an affordable dash kit (along with others).<P>When they first moved to St. Pete, they hooked up with our club and I think we've all benifited. The company is VERY open to new ideas. If you see something that can be made from fiberglass, I recommend you talk to them to see if they can make it. You never know, you could get a free sample if your product recommendation goes to market.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Roy  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||6
